Agent Compat Lab

This product includes software derived from:
  Model Compatibility Suite
  https://github.com/swiss-ai/model-compatibility-suite
  Source commit: 531a52813d9be66d9fdf13c6a9d30875a770df66
  License: Apache License 2.0

Modifications include project rebranding, distinct Codex/Hermes/OpenClaw agent
profiles, stateful tool-result round trips, Responses API continuation probes,
streamed parallel tool reconstruction, compatibility matrices, timing,
credential redaction, Markdown reports, and offline protocol tests. The
original mcs Python package and full model suite remain available for
compatibility and attribution continuity.
